# p5 mcp discover: a 2026-07-28 stdio server that writes a line that is not JSON-RPC
# (`Server started on stdio`) just before its discover answer (p5-mcp-discover-stdio.ts
# `banner`). fx v0.0.16 keeps such a line aside -- it names no request -- and reads the
# answer after it (`onRefusedLine`, `keepStray`, src/mcp/server.zig:769-776@481104fd): the
# server is ready at 2026-07-28. `home wire` is what the server was sent.
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-banner-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-banner-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 6
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 3
snap show
home wire
